  "2026-09-18T04:33:51.530Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all statuses for 1269 and provenance_resolver_zero_success plus broader resolver outcomes; read the completed outcome-vocabulary feature and open observability charter in full, and checked open/in-progress work. The new report concerns success accounting after repair rather than the completed outcome-vocabulary or individual resolver fixes. Intake remains open and unclaimed."
files[2]{path,scope,note}:
  src/sdk/governance/provenance-health.ts,project,Reported health aggregation owner; implementation investigation pending
  src/core/history/history.ts,project,Reported immutable outcome recording boundary; implementation investigation pending
body: "Report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1269\n\nThe reporter confirms current model and version probes succeed, but health still counts seven historical failures from August 22 and no recorded successes. Treat this as a reported diagnostic accounting defect; do not describe the repaired resolver itself as broken. Independent reproduction is pending.\n\nImplementation should preserve append-only history and bounded, privacy-safe reason codes. Evaluate recording resolved outcomes or deriving genuine probe successes, and expose the measurement window so historical failures are distinguishable from current regressions."
